  ["Breastfeeding is a foolproof contraceptive."], [False],
  [Lactational amenorrhoea works only about six months, and only with exclusive, frequent feeding.],
  ["Withdrawal is a reliable method."], [False],
  [Fluid released before ejaculation can carry sperm; self-control fails often.],
